<h3>Fix</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>No more double counting</b> — adding the same RevenueCat project twice (for example as <code>1c0213f5</code> and <code>proj1c0213f5</code>) or the same custom endpoint no longer counts its MRR twice. The extra copy is marked <i>Duplicate</i> in Sources.</li>
</ul>
